  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen riktar sig mot Agenda 2030 m&#xe5;let 3: H&#xe4;lsa och V&#xe4;lbefinnande. Den tematiska inriktningen &#xe4;r h&#xe4;lsa, j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter
Diskussion om val av denna JPO tj&#xe4;nst har skett is samr&#xe5;d med UD och Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPO program (Junior Professional Officers) is an important part of  the total Swedish focus on increased Swedish participation in international organizations. The program offers young graduates the opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations. This position is addressing the Agenda 2030 goal 3: Good Health and Well-being. Thematic area is health, gender equality and human rights.</narrative>
